psc-kernel-payload — licensing
==============================

This repository is BUILD ORCHESTRATION for the AutoBleem PlayStation Classic
kernel-flasher payload. It contains configuration, patches and scripts; it does
not vendor the upstream sources it builds (Buildroot, the Linux kernel, BlueZ,
busybox, etc. are fetched at build time).

- AutoBleem-authored files in this repository (scripts/, board/psc/post-*.sh,
  configs/, docs) are licensed GPL-3.0-or-later, matching autobleem/AutoBleem2.

- Each component this tree builds keeps its own upstream licence:
    * Linux kernel (autobleem/psc-kernel) — GPL-2.0
    * BlueZ + the sixaxis patch (autobleem/psc-bluez) — GPL-2.0 / LGPL-2.1
    * Buildroot and its package recipes — GPL-2.0-or-later
    * busybox — GPL-2.0; dropbear — MIT-style; ntfs-3g — GPL-2.0; etc.

- The AutoBleem name, logo and theme artwork are NOT covered by this grant
  (see autobleem/AutoBleem2 TRADEMARKS.md).

The full GPL-3.0 text is at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt
